<title>USA: Cryomedical sues Endocare.</title>
<headline>Cryomedical sues Endocare.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKILLE, Md 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cryomedical Sciences Inc said Wednesday it has filed suit against Endocare Inc and Zhao Hua Chang in Circuit Court for Montgomery County, Md.</p>
<p>The company charges, among other things, that Chang, a former employee, and Endocare, his current employer, engaged in unfair competition against Cryomedical and engaged in civil conspiracy against it, and that Endocare misappropriated trade secrets.</p>
<p>Chang and Endocare have denied all allegations.</p>
<p>The court has issued a temporary restraining order preventing Chang and Endocare from engaging in certain activities.</p>
<p>Cryomedical specializes in cyrosurgical methods and devices.</p>
